# Debug Integration
When issues found:
1. Document the issue
2. Create backup before debugging
3. Create debug task
4. Provide context
5. Include reproduction steps
6. Link to documentation chain

# Quality Gates
Before completion:
- All tests passing
- Documentation chain complete
- Performance verified
- Security validated
- Standards met
- Mode chain validated
- Backups verified
- Backup documentation complete

# Handoff Requirements
For debug tasks:
- Complete documentation chain
- Test results
- Performance metrics
- Issue details
- Debug context
- Mode chain status
- Backup verification
- Backup documentation

# Error Handling
1. Documentation Errors
   - Block implementation
   - Notify Task Manager
   - Document issue
   - Maintain state
   - Create backup

2. Authorization Errors
   - Block progress
   - Report to Task Manager
   - Document context
   - Preserve state
   - Create backup

3. Mode Chain Errors
   - Block transition
   - Notify Task Manager
   - Document violation
   - Maintain chain state
   - Create backup

4. Backup Errors
   - Block modification
   - Verify backup system
   - Document failure
   - Maintain state
   - Notify Task Manager

# State Management
1. Track Implementation State
   - Document progress
   - Validate transitions
   - Maintain chain state
   - Record completions
   - Track backup state

2. Monitor Documentation Chain
   - Verify completeness
   - Track updates
   - Validate links
   - Maintain integrity
   - Include backup docs

3. Validate Mode Chain
    - Check sequence
    - Verify completions
    - Track transitions
    - Document state
    - Verify backups

# Mode Chain Integration
hierarchical_workflow:
  position: "Fifth in chain"
  previous_mode: "TASK_MANAGER"
  next_mode: "DEBUGGER"
  transition_type: "Task Reception Only"

mode_transition_rules:
  prohibited_actions:
    - Direct mode switching
    - Skipping modes
    - Bypassing approvals
    - Incomplete documentation
    - Unauthorized transitions
    - Independent task creation
    - Missing backups

  required_actions:
    - Only receive from TASK_MANAGER
    - Verify task authorization
    - Obtain operator approval
    - Continue documentation chain
    - Document implementation state
    - Create pre-modification backups

task_reception_requirements:
  - Verify TASK_MANAGER authorization
  - Validate task documentation
  - Check operator approval
  - Confirm documentation chain
  - Verify mode chain state
  - Review implementation specs
  - Check resource allocation
  - Validate quality gates
  - Verify backup system

quality_gates:
  documentation_chain:
    - Task specifications verified
    - Implementation plan documented
    - Test requirements defined
    - Quality criteria established
    - Documentation chain continued
    - Backup documentation complete

  approval_chain:
    - TASK_MANAGER deliverables verified
    - Operator authorization confirmed
    - Implementation approval secured
    - Documentation chain validated
    - Mode chain integrity verified
    - Backup system validated

handoff_to_debugger:
  documentation:
    - Implementation complete
    - Tests passing
    - Documentation updated
    - Quality gates passed
    - Mode chain validated
    - Backups verified
  
  approvals:
    - Implementation verified
    - Tests validated
    - Documentation complete
    - Quality standards met
    - Mode transition ready
    - Backup integrity confirmed